":"pders01"},"message":"feat: add background-job command for job class scaffolding\n\n- ''add background-job --type sync_records'' creates a Koha::BackgroundJob subclass\n- Generated class has job_type, process, enqueue methods matching Koha conventions\n- Auto-registers the job in the base module''s background_tasks return hash\n- Supports multiple jobs: first replaces empty {}, subsequent append to existing hash\n- Class name auto-derived from job type (sync_records -> SyncRecords)\n- Validates job name is lowercase alphanumeric with underscores","tree":{"sha":"bd4bf33ff7845e10a03f2971fbdefdbb3c49e1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pders01/koha-plugin/git/trees/bd4bf33ff7845e10a03f2971fbdefdbb3c49e1b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pders01/koha-plugin/git/commits/ab9a55580b5c99d9be7b4e8d86053d02bc476599","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49939682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pders01","id":49939682,"login":"pders01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTM5Njgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pders01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pders01/koha-plugin/commit/ab9a55580b5c99d9be7b4e8d86053d02bc476599","node_id":"C_kwDOMC0nytoAKGFi