/pnpm/pnpm/releases/tag/v12.3.3):\npnpm 12.3.3\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/pnpm/pnpm/compare/v12.3.2...v12.3.3)\n\n#### Patch Changes\n\n- Fixed concurrent installs sharing a store occasionally failing with an\nENOENT error while importing a package file\n[#&#8203;14353](https://redirect.github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/14353).\n\n- Sped up writing the lockfile in large workspaces\n[#&#8203;14352](https://redirect.github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/14352).\n\n- Sped up dependency resolution in large workspaces\n[#&#8203;14352](https://redirect.github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/14352).\n\n- pnpm now runs through Node.js when it was installed by a tool that\nskips build scripts, such as Vercel''s `packageManager` provisioning,\nBun, Deno, or `npm install --ignore-scripts`. Those installs previously\nfailed with `syntax error near unexpected token '')''`. They still cannot\nrun pnpm on Windows. On macOS only a shell can start it\n[#&#8203;14346](https://redirect.github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/14346).\n\n<!-- sponsors -->\n\n#### Platinum Sponsors\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\n<a href=\"https://bit.cloud/?utm_source=pnpm&utm_medium=release_notes\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img\nsrc=\"https://pnpm.io/img/users/bit.svg\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Bit\"></a>\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\n<a href=\"https://openai.com/?utm_source=pnpm&utm_medium=release_notes\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n          <picture>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://pnpm.io/img/users/openai_dark.svg\" />\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://pnpm.io/img/users/openai_light.svg\" />\n<img src=\"https://pnpm.io/img/users/openai_dark.svg\" width=\"160\"\nalt=\"OpenAI\" />\n          </picture>\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\n<a href=\"https://notion.com/?utm_source=pnpm&utm_medium=relea