nsole output unchanged.\n- Also hoists the per-pattern `to_string_lossy().replace()` allocation in the node_modules walk (pre-existing; reused for the `--filter` check).\n\nStacked on #183.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRimcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAunQQAJaz53lQixATlFi11aGDpAsR\n+zdsduTpxwWDKGbaGpkyini4ucNYPP1NiD6offEMFHfSlqGqg/nZuHPUO3wYcxfv\nZ2LHyDE6vk6P2AeAcM3hujcYogXuwJCzLe8kvgiohJnuRyq/DpqEHM6WTBlyHVhF\nrd3T3A7GgGMAGvIMURW9Zl63HRsxlowFIZ0XxpAaq8q7LyC9z56L+8LyeHW/yEc2\n2XCKw7Pwqktl6HJDg6xD2gXhsbe4qPHBCQg1YONgGzjDlYmgv1xxUjelx0Gm3/9x\nQjOm3eUBlzFKT8WbaPzLVM2ue4WGP87e1w2LrsHY0v0Khpf7GEJeES2B5zok9+NA\nLCp8RkKubME1RVK+7+SehLRxRMHp878eW91fTcqwPCOXhJKOtruYwxQW42jIoJzJ\nrmWjjI/H4oEvwa9ohQJ3YpsVdtjFAaoPP4tieP9hW1JNfmL/q7hdKg0SdQPm+xtn\nUcw58G66l0bXJIvjmkkLq5eBENyW+/pmr298B6moqBg8E+51gXJhEeX/U9Ylb1ce\nWaRGH3LmnyqbR/tsydR8LHjHtDIqd/ziR1cAtJVZbW/8DkovA83Ch3/eCwhOsosG\neQ1IDYtNT2Jvfa2/8Jry5hfC0AlNG8PLEbsgEyNYS3U6yVOI9Gvwfse4iaFGtLDJ\nhd6uY8fegi6zrPC5Q50z\n=ORot\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T09:04:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us