","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf: process files in parallel with rayon (#179)\n\n## Summary\n\n- File processing was single-threaded — reading ~105k files and running each case''s per-file test one at a time. The formatter task alone spent 4m29s of CI''s ~7.5-minute critical path this way. Files are now read and tested through rayon; `pnpm test` and file restoration stay sequential after the parallel phase.\n- Output is byte-identical to the sequential runner: rayon''s ordered collects keep diagnostics in file order, and the formatter''s inline Prettier-classification warnings are returned as notes and printed after the parallel phase (printing mid-loop would interleave). Verified against a sequential baseline build on the compressor and formatter tasks, plus codegen/transformer end-to-end runs including `pnpm test`.\n- Formatter task: 120s → 29s wall on 16 cores; expect roughly 3× on the 4-core CI runner.\n- `Cargo.lock` also picks up the oxc 0.120 → 0.138 re-resolution against current oxc main — the committed lock was stale, and CI regenerates it on every build anyway.","tree":{"sha":"cf78c8d85c73a3f3084cfb5533b16b54e23bb317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/trees/cf78c8d85c73a3f3084cfb5533b16b54e23bb317"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/commits/d65dc1e7d8df626cf8f4bab689db37c205acd6a0","verification":{"payload":"tree cf78c8d85c73a3f3084cfb5533b16b54e23bb317\nparent 9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f\nauthor Dunqing <dengqing0821@gmail.com> 1782982829 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782982829 +0800\n\nperf: process files in parallel with rayon (#179)\n\n## Summary\n\n- File processing was single-threaded — reading ~105k files and running each case''s per-file test one at a time. The formatter task alone spent 4m29s of CI''s ~7.5-minute critical path this way. Files are now read and tested through rayon; `pnpm test` and file restoration stay sequential after the parallel phase.\n- Output is byte-identical to the sequential runner: rayon''s ordered collects keep diagnostics in file order, and the formatter''s inline Prettier-classification warnings are returned as notes and printed after the parallel phase (printing mid-loop would interleave). Verified against a sequential baseline build on the compressor and formatter tasks, plus codegen/transformer end-to-end runs including `pnpm test`.\n- Formatter task: 120s → 29s wall on 16 cores; expect roughly 3× on the 4-core CI runner.\n- `Cargo.lock` also picks up the oxc 0.120 → 0.138 re-resolution against current oxc main — the committed lock was stale, and CI regenerates it on every build anyway.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRiitCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7xwQAK1brE6GkRRqliMvLbiFMh2N\nwqxZrq24/VhITi+rUdmWEA+BrCfgChtxJvF6UyH67MrQsfMm8VUVKB3W16FA7Dz6\nQLQUkKvYBKj3fUpjqs19FNRuERaUIMaugkSAHksteFDm3LpVuH7z8R5mVslVU3mx\nah0/vZIGEkf8iYXbxsQT3BPZnIMrZr6WrklldvacA5L4YsvTZ1Bi26tuXM8j0Gul\nW0yHDDdGP2RXGSibhbxE233kcdWz2621UqY6wj7d97wB3e+dvs55ofRwB0CV6Y2n\nPzWDiS+3dO6iS4pnTL3dD+F37+vTtYv10VOjx1+Vn073dgWE7pAb4bfqAkECyUzz\n+ivkOMnT+4ZDwulTsA7TH3bZtFEyDvsnYwqCc8NQ90UrmFRAAEUuafpGxGvl3Hue\niYAi/FJY9aZjoHb8il3Ob89UpVTVXgYqaaR9srtMTcRig03x9u5KQfeZX5p1d9i8\nPHTjufty79lDaiLNyu0OUzwPFms+wtfd4GuOI8pDnY09X/f+5k0SVEL0bfph05sB\nM9fvMUCgZK8UbXMFbZRK28dKVKo7fcjXsjb/4gxsZH63t9PcG/ryQOfqfrWr//AY\nIJ80TMWmdJ56wK5/Cscnc4Nf9ZpFeIj/qWX1iUITf0TMbjLkgelEWTOZBIAdoJJh\n2AUbszapm8ubWx9lPAPV\n=AcMN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T09:00:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commit/d65dc1e7d8df626cf8f4bab689db37c205acd6a0","node_id":"C_kwDOMEGZSNoAKGQ2NWRjMWU3ZDhkZjYyNmNmOGY0YmFiNjg5ZGIzN2MyMDVhY2Q2YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commit/9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f","sha":"9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f"}],"sha":"d65dc1e7d8df626cf8f4bab689db37c205acd6a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/d65dc1e7d8df626cf8f4bab689db37c205acd6a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29533304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dunqing","id":29533304,"login":"Dunqing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTMzMzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:58:28Z","email":"dengqing0821@gmail.com","name":"Dunqing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:58:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: skip scheduled runs when oxc and monitor-oxc are unchanged (#181)\n\n## Summary\n\n- The cron fires every 3 hours regardless of whether oxc or monitor-oxc moved. A `guard` job now checks whether the exact (monitor-oxc, oxc) commit pair already has a recorded green scheduled run and skips the whole workflow if so; a `record` job saves that marker after a fully green scheduled run.\n- PR, push, and dispatch runs are never skipped: the guard only exists on `schedule` events, and jobs treat a skipped guard as \"changed\" (`!cancelled() && needs.guard.outputs.unchanged != ''true''`).\n- The marker is keyed on the oxc commit the Build job actually tested, not the one the guard resolved — if oxc main moves mid-run they differ, and the safe outcome is one redundant run, never a wrong skip. A red run records nothing, so the next cron retries.\n\nStacked on #180.","tree":{"sha":"b8c1490b8970e248e75df4368e682dabc542875a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/trees/b8c1490b8970e248e75df4368e682dabc542875a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/commits/9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f","verification":{"payload":"tree b8c1490b8970e248e75df4368e682dabc542875a\nparent 9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1\nauthor Dunqing <dengqing0821@gmail.com> 1782982708 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782982708 +0800\n\nci: skip scheduled runs when oxc and monitor-oxc are unchanged (#181)\n\n## Summary\n\n- The cron fires every 3 hours regardless of whether oxc or monitor-oxc moved. A `guard` job now checks whether the exact (monitor-oxc, oxc) commit pair already has a recorded green scheduled run and skips the whole workflow if so; a `record` job saves that marker after a fully green scheduled run.\n- PR, push, and dispatch runs are never skipped: the guard only exists on `schedule` events, and jobs treat a skipped guard as \"changed\" (`!cancelled() && needs.guard.outputs.unchanged != ''true''`).\n- The marker is keyed on the oxc commit the Build job actually tested, not the one the guard resolved — if oxc main moves mid-run they differ, and the safe outcome is one redundant run, never a wrong skip. A red run records nothing, so the next cron retries.\n\nStacked on #180.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRig0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXCAQAHePgOCo4lJRGxtso0S2xQTK\nD8Qm/kuTnVEtRPa64m5cmwspfDgT8Xf3YynwI5i1o8TPgWUxyOTdsmlJ3WCNAzF+\nrwNBqqAkgLjGQo12qa2AKUtDW1MZmSnQ03qWVQ4WqPd0RRLxKvHWsXeutPThceZA\nw1rIHiMg25Y8ajQrDSwZ/EoKUcT+HqKd05P8DJGbul9wSQ43v5S/OSr9oSCZ0meB\nwPJXTU79f7d77v2GnkTCNBtonYgM3+vsIF3YG1pKFs4ch6UXhxDGjNSgnT116pGH\ne///lt/N/RKl+uMaBstQPM9nzxZ34t7ZcEnbM4pRnhclCofXwQ8VUZOMa2qoQPHK\nlB6dAEUysV6I0cPcxfllNA5Se6A7xXOAWSApyxdSXNQVNQcigA2az9n314TY0e92\nuwaRmtCWOUizZA1XQFp6xxmXnGCZlTK+fbSseBeyfu0j+WNiQmSAbEJhYpQwzU6s\n9ozQTEgML/fhRR4t6nyTfFIzQrBXqGTdS4KdOlmwU1c5EbSIQ5yO6Czpkxi8flxO\nmt7XU0XtVGWPyOmTC3Krn0ulw0/FQgo4x/xeByQ/luA2qJf693YEu6nLqRJo/cZq\noIuezQPWagkOqULJb4NWPZIPK9jdHfexjR0U0bv0BO/qCdFi865gV+PFr+qXBqCM\njCqxBtaiESaBa5scuoGn\n=hnOe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T08:58:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commit/9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f","node_id":"C_kwDOMEGZSNoAKDlmYzE2ZDRkMjdjY2Y2M2E0MDcwMGEzN2FkMmU0NmFmMjZiYmRkOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commit/9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1","sha":"9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1"}],"sha":"9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/9fc16d4d27ccf63a40700a37ad2e46af26bbdd9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29533304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dunqing","id":29533304,"login":"Dunqing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTMzMzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:56:28Z","email":"dengqing0821@gmail.com","name":"Dunqing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:56:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: reuse built binaries when inputs are unchanged (#180)\n\n## Summary\n\nTwo applications of the same idea — skip a ~2-minute compile when its inputs haven''t changed, which is common for the 3-hourly scheduled runs:\n\n- **Build job**: cache `target/release/monitor-oxc` keyed on the oxc commit plus a hash of our sources; on a hit, skip toolchain setup and `cargo build` entirely and upload the cached binary.\n- **Test262 job**: cache `target/coverage/oxc_coverage` keyed on the oxc commit; on a hit, run the binary directly — it resolves the repo from the working directory (`project-root` crate), so cargo isn''t needed.\n\nStacked on #178.","tree":{"sha":"131de0d71a4b6665a43d05ef616da2966e8549b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/trees/131de0d71a4b6665a43d05ef616da2966e8549b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/commits/9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 131de0d71a4b6665a43d05ef616da2966e8549b6\nparent ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea\nauthor Dunqing <dengqing0821@gmail.com> 1782982588 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782982588 +0800\n\nci: reuse built binaries when inputs are unchanged (#180)\n\n## Summary\n\nTwo applications of the same idea — skip a ~2-minute compile when its inputs haven''t changed, which is common for the 3-hourly scheduled runs:\n\n- **Build job**: cache `target/release/monitor-oxc` keyed on the oxc commit plus a hash of our sources; on a hit, skip toolchain setup and `cargo build` entirely and upload the cached binary.\n- **Test262 job**: cache `target/coverage/oxc_coverage` keyed on the oxc commit; on a hit, run the binary directly — it resolves the repo from the working directory (`project-root` crate), so cargo isn''t needed.\n\nStacked on #178.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRie8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPp8QAK2R/q1ND131obIMZj2jV9k4\nwFykrfTkljAp6FyRu1NcGZ/lFf6pl3vpIGO9m0YM2qq+yBeU8zJuNmN8M8IEnhPD\nhy7XPtucqecJ8pkgh0pQ9ITUHsDTMY+0H5RcsNr9pS3Ki7RXwzcVPpyvxGX9Mu3S\nPC7qs22C0JqZYbwBupzxepwaUyzag7/NLiBXwf5bGqupUrNDGWPD+x7MNqx/b3Or\ncCiiMHa2PNyafeRk4maXOzMBKRTWph9L6csIL4X/u56c5L8rAO1Qez0ndoOZyzhe\nCCKZmvn1TD+fHMg3rEulzL9f3uajtlubroCL9mg9QHkFIJHW0ROd7jNiacwWg3XU\nLgHtmA+hg6myRnksyBvgcwzvTDTHn3A/4kKNfkF6y3McJa2ZxhG5P+fS2t4BBP2R\n46gxyIlpEIKrZNPfCaGnEzCraDTqVrzUSqAjUBoVI454N6OwP0WUfM7F2Vx70bvt\nC/HzLRQZXDgMppyq6D4Op0v9S6xVP5jrXmR65yVIqmL9sDf0vY8DbthVeoh9GMVs\nwqkHQZBRhMtguauOqoT4TQDgV5gunx2aPClT2ct6DcRGhpDRtRTqq4Qg2e3tfrLG\nvbdoWW71J6jjkkqxILIu6gnI5QjNoKh0AjPwZI2UnN7Lt6mjy/rhuLv0kbbjhQYM\ncs0Aed9YI+k1c8FhUVG4\n=KEgj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T08:56:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commit/9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1","node_id":"C_kwDOMEGZSNoAKDlhNzRjNWQ5YmFmM2YyODU0YmQ0N2U5OTJjZTc1ZWYyZDUxYWE5ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commit/ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea","sha":"ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea"}],"sha":"9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/9a74c5d9baf3f2854bd47e992ce75ef2d51aa9e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29533304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dunqing","id":29533304,"login":"Dunqing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTMzMzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:53:28Z","email":"dengqing0821@gmail.com","name":"Dunqing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:53:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: re-enable test262 runtime job (#178)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Re-enables the Test262 job, disabled in a427989 (\"skip 262\") while `cargo coverage runtime` rotted upstream — oxc-project/oxc#24034 reimplements the runner and **must merge first** (against current oxc main the command is a no-op stub, so this job would go green without testing anything).\n- Resolves the test262 ref from oxc''s `.github/scripts/clone-parallel.mjs` pin at run time instead of a hardcoded SHA, so the fixture checkout can''t drift from oxc''s committed `runtime.snap` again.","tree":{"sha":"f6d28e67afa65161242029fc1d46c532e1079c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/trees/f6d28e67afa65161242029fc1d46c532e1079c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/commits/ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea","verification":{"payload":"tree f6d28e67afa65161242029fc1d46c532e1079c96\nparent 784ccda058eb8d14fde1559b3945edd9b69798b4\nauthor Dunqing <dengqing0821@gmail.com> 1782982408 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782982408 +0800\n\nci: re-enable test262 runtime job (#178)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Re-enables the Test262 job, disabled in a427989 (\"skip 262\") while `cargo coverage runtime` rotted upstream — oxc-project/oxc#24034 reimplements the runner and **must merge first** (against current oxc main the command is a no-op stub, so this job would go green without testing anything).\n- Resolves the test262 ref from oxc''s `.github/scripts/clone-parallel.mjs` pin at run time instead of a hardcoded SHA, so the fixture checkout can''t drift from oxc''s committed `runtime.snap` again.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRicICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8tIQAFp4jnHlQlC6VXkMW/O/mpef\npkOjLGSZgOOCq5HyJY6x20JKiUOOaI8ArMimffZenso3ZTK9gkSSTZbmoYRSMLHP\nl8opK4ksX4lfcfxOKa7OFB1jT++zAk19yrACLgemR+aIetBhp7Q9lNq8hAAJuy2W\nv1bUbwlvCCx9yDPJRoSBi1Gv+LVWxs9iPQ7SuGrBXBMe3VSU7eLq/H0fhHiYNsEu\nZqV5v1uhfEJ8N1RsHETknns