fc6a4b43ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/ccab7d575d7b60f739137db34875d9fc6a4b43ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29533304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dunqing","id":29533304,"login":"Dunqing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTMzMzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/commits/784ccda058eb8d14fde1559b3945edd9b69798b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:51:24Z","email":"dengqing0821@gmail.com","name":"Dunqing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T08:51:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: checkout oxc in the security workflow (#182)\n\n## Summary\n\n- The security action runs `cargo metadata` when `Cargo.lock` changed in the PR, which fails with `failed to read /home/runner/work/monitor-oxc/oxc/crates/oxc/Cargo.toml` — the `oxc` path dependency (`../oxc`) was never checked out. The workflow (added in #155) postdates the last Cargo.lock-touching PR, so the gap only surfaced now with #179.\n- Mirror the Build job''s oxc checkout before running the action. The action''s internal monitor-oxc checkout is unaffected since `../oxc` sits outside the workspace directory.\n- Verified by #179 (stacked on this): its security run exercises the cargo path against a real Cargo.lock change.","tree":{"sha":"68f09bb64e965d63b73f4ad46513bc90cd45dd42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/trees/68f09bb64e965d63b73f4ad46513bc90cd45dd42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/commits/784ccda058eb8d14fde1559b3945edd9b69798b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 68f09bb64e965d63b73f4ad46513bc90cd45dd42\nparent 26319167d4a362ea67e737ddf9581686895b94d8\nauthor Dunqing <dengqing0821@gmail.com> 1782982284 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782982284 +0800\n\nci: checkout oxc in the security workflow (#182)\n\n## Summary\n\n- The security action runs `cargo metadata` when `Cargo.lock` changed in the PR, which fails with `failed to read /home/runner/work/monitor-oxc/oxc/crates/oxc/Cargo.toml` — the `oxc` path dependency (`../oxc`) was never checked out. The workflow (added in #155) postdates the last Cargo.lock-touching PR, so the gap only surfaced now with #179.\n- Mirror the Build job''s oxc checkout before running the action. The action''s internal monitor-oxc checkout is unaffected since `../oxc` sits outside the workspace directory.\n- Verified by #179 (stacked on this): its security run exercises the cargo path against a real Cargo.lock change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRiaMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfp8QAByWaRUali50YKK5KzQC8vkd\nUrlSpKCaGIFQtqoi4y6VD/ZeZFXy+YowTyrHRaQ1vm0rp7Ed4xPatr3FksFT1F5z\nADm25dND65C/PvmEQalXweaQ5F8sskQMlA9ax9OHHP5yNtulIM0Zn/yXYT9GVb9Y\nfx9NDWmf3VCh2ycUTVV+1U9p+CRPoudfxnXh50SaQvikYajN8hlgrKMtVMgSODCV\nAdqW2TYPVu8dVtKM0sDdy3d/bLuLuUFhBTWhWIOKc92YkYprfqwIYN75LwVHHxim\n592VEmflnrpR8twCv1LK9QpYOTqvM6g0egfLZiIH2jDjc3Y1G0jObxLaWEUCG3PX\nU21WN11Znx15eyBc916ZbxEQJrPH502NIEwPRl7h718i2HLmSxM8tZdg5Uj6Yf5p\n4zVTSXJxLIfsg6Q+aWeq4TKHXhlHKiTvxm1vNQY3TmVZhwg4cjV+9qC5wrveRbik\nZ89oGny0yNhWhG4hB6L1hZHoBEKC2Sc25671rwIRy70sXSo2oX2/UgOy/zC+z+vv\n0QvTJCyy