6-05T01:13:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: include monitored commit in CI status (#173)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Resolve the monitored `oxc-project/oxc` ref in the status job.\n- Include a linked short commit SHA in the Monitor Oxc status comment\nbefore the suite table.\n\n## Why\n\nWhen CI is dispatched with a branch or other ref, the status comment did\nnot show the exact Oxc commit being tested. Showing the resolved commit\nmakes the reported results easier to audit.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `ruby -e ''require \"yaml\"; YAML.load_file(\".github/workflows/ci.yml\");\nputs \"yaml ok\"''`\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Cameron <cameron.clark@hey.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2422ab5d85d6b05adec5279576dcdb38b911fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/trees/a2422ab5d85d6b05adec5279576dcdb38b911fe7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/monitor-oxc/git/commits/c5f8be02175a9a8f892cb7034d44af03a7f41b93","verification":{"payload":"tree a2422ab5d85d6b05adec5279576dcdb38b911fe7\nparent f694a6de491416e0d4c1b83f82bef8598e2999d5\nauthor Cameron <cameron.clark@hey.com> 1780621999 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780621999 +0800\n\nfeat: include monitored commit in CI status (#173)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Resolve the monitored `oxc-project/oxc` ref in the status job.\n- Include a linked short commit SHA in the Monitor Oxc status comment\nbefore the suite table.\n\n## Why\n\nWhen CI is dispatched with a branch or other ref, the status comment did\nnot show the exact Oxc commit being tested. Showing the resolved commit\nmakes the reported results easier to audit.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `ruby -e ''require \"yaml\"; YAML.load_file(\".github/workflows/ci.yml\");\nputs \"yaml ok\"''`\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Cameron <cameron.clark@hey.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.gith