 own h1 (the\ngallery has one heading of its own).\n\nGrouping a component''s sections makes them contiguous, which moves elements\nbelow them onto a different sub-pixel row: demo-date sits at viewport top\n384.140625 before and 383.734375 after, with document height unchanged, so six\nbaselines re-render identical content at a different antialiasing phase (and the\npicker panel''s clip box rounds one pixel taller). Regenerated.\n\nThe Popconfirm locators are section-scoped now that the Popover demo, which\ncarries the disabled Popconfirm, precedes the Popconfirm demo.","tree":{"sha":"8d7b335e4f59408dc9700d1eecf0488c070bb13b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcblakesley/Controls/git/trees/8d7b335e4f59408dc9700d1eecf0488c070bb13b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcblakesley/Controls/git/commits/b5d03a0d972215a010211ed7f56eee645bc8f2c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17915296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dcblakesley","id":17915296,"login":"dcblakesley","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTE1Mjk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesley","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dcblakesley/Controls/commi