ithub.com/dcblakesleyWss","id":137657032,"login":"dcblakesleyWss","node_id":"U_kgDOCDR6yA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesleyWss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesleyWss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesleyWss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesleyWss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesleyWss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcblakesleyWss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcblakesley/Controls/commits/827b8f608c2e0754830f41a6759be1ea9a51c874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T16:33:28Z","email":"dblakesley@webstaurantstore.com","name":"David Blakesley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T16:33:28Z","email":"dblakesley@webstaurantstore.com","name":"David Blakesley"},"message":"Cut 10.8.3: FormAutoSave, FocusFirstField, FocusAsync, Suggestions, LabelContent\n\nConsolidates six weeks of accumulated unreleased work into a changelog entry\nand bumps both package versions. Additive/non-breaking throughout: two new\nform-level helpers, focus on every control, two new field parameters, a\ntwo-way-bindable EditRadioEnum \"Other\" field, and the event-chaining and\nnull-attribute-erasure contracts widened to cover every control that can use\nthem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28b25744ed33d4935467a788703a2e15f8e18d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcblakesley/Controls/git/trees/28b25744ed33d4935467a788703a2e15f8e18d58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcblakesley/Controls/git/commits/827b8f608c2e0754830f41a6759be1ea9a51c874","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137657032?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co